---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';

const docSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'TechArticle',
      '@id': 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/support/documentation/#article',
      url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/support/documentation/',
      headline: 'Official Factory Certifications & Laboratory Reports — BOHOL',
      description: 'Review official laboratory compliance certificates, safety test reports, and FDA registration documents for BOHOL Smart Manufacturing Co., Ltd.',
      inLanguage: 'en-US',
      mainEntityOfPage: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/support/documentation/',
      datePublished: '2024-01-01T08:00:00+08:00',
      dateModified: new Date().toISOString(),
      author: {
        '@type': 'Person',
        name: 'Alex Chen',
        jobTitle: 'Chief Compliance & Quality Engineering Director',
        worksFor: {
          '@type': 'Organization',
          name: 'BOHOL'
        },
        url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/about/'
      },
      publisher: {
        '@type': 'Organization',
        name: 'BOHOL',
        url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com',
        logo: {
          '@type': 'ImageObject',
          url: 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/images/bohol-logo-horiz-dark.webp'
        }
      }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'FAQPage',
      '@id': 'https://adulttoysglobal.com/support/documentation/#faq',
      mainEntity: [
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: 'What certifications does BOHOL hold for adult wellness hardware?',
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'BOHOL holds an active 10-certificate compliance portfolio including ISO 9001:2015, ISO 13485:2016, US FDA Facility Registration (FEI: 3014686907), FCC Part 15 SDoC, CE EMC Directive 2014/30/EU, RoHS 2.0 (EU 2015/863), UKCA (SI 2016/1091), UN38.3 lithium battery safety, and IPX7 laboratory submersible verification.'
          }
        },
        {
          '@type': 'Question',
          name: 'How can distributors obtain unredacted laboratory test reports?',
          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'Authorized wholesale buyers and OEM brand partners can request complete unredacted high-resolution PDF test dossiers, raw metrology logs, and bill-of-materials declarations under a mutual non-disclosure agreement (NDA).'
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout
  title="Official Factory Certifications & Laboratory Reports — BOHOL"
  description="Review official laboratory compliance certificates, safety test reports, and FDA registration documents for BOHOL Smart Manufacturing Co., Ltd."
  schema={docSchema}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT / COMPLIANCE & CERTIFICATIONS</p>
    <h1>Verified Standards.<br/>Official Certifications.</h1>
    <p>International regulatory compliance and audited laboratory documentation for retail brands, distribution partners, and customs clearance.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- AUTHOR BYLINE & MACHINE-READABLE FRESHNESS SIGNALS -->
  <div class="geo-byline-bar" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 1.25rem auto 2.5rem; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #475569; padding: 8px 18px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 9999px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <span>🏭 Verified Entity: <strong>BOHOL Compliance Office</strong></span>
      <span style="color: #cbd5e1;">•</span>
      <span>Audited by: <a href="/about/" style="color: #0284c7; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700;">Alex Chen (Chief Quality Officer)</a></span>
      <span style="color: #cbd5e1;">•</span>
      <span>Published: <time datetime="2024-01-01">Jan 1, 2024</time></span>
      <span style="color: #cbd5e1;">•</span>
      <span>Audit Cycle: <time datetime="2026-10-18">Oct 18, 2026 (Active Validated)</time></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="reading" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 max(5vw, 24px) 60px;">
    <!-- 10-Certificate Array Banner -->
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.04); margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;">
        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0;">What Is Included in BOHOL's Complete 10-Certificate Regulatory Portfolio?</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 4px 0 0;">Brand & Compliance Holder: <strong>BOHOL Global Brand (BOHOL 官方全球品牌与国际认证体系)</strong></p>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 9999px;">✓ Laboratory Audited</span>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 10px;">
        <img
          src="/images/bohol-certificates-strip.webp"
          width="3751"
          height="467"
          alt="BOHOL Global Brand Official Laboratory Certificates: ISO 9001, FCC, CE, RoHS, BACL, UKCA, EMC, BKC, MSDS, FDA"
          style="width: 100%; min-width: 1000px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; display: block;"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 12px;">How Do BOHOL's Audited Laboratory Standards Comply with Global Markets?</h2>
    <p>Below is the verified registry of active certificates and laboratory test reports issued to <strong>BOHOL Global Brand</strong> for intimate wellness devices, medical-grade liquid silicone rubber (LSR), and rechargeable lithium polymer battery packs.</p>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0 36px;">
      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">ISO 9001:2015 Quality System</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Scope: Intimate wellness hardware R&D, cleanroom injection, manufacturing and sales.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Cert: 24CN34502390Q · ACM / IAS / IAF</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">US FDA Facility Registration</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Active confirmation for adult personal massager production and cleanroom LSR silicone.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">FEI: 3014686907 · Fiscal Year 2025</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">FCC Part 15 SDoC (USA)</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Supplier's Declaration of Conformity for radio frequency & electromagnetic safety.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Cert: SSP23090094C · CCUT Lab</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">CE EMC Directive 2014/30/EU</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Complies with EN IEC 55014-1/2 electrical safety directives across all EU member states.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Cert: BKC23114421KC · BKC Testing</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">RoHS 2.0 (EU 2015/863)</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Non-toxic biocompatible silicone test with 0 restricted phthalates, lead, or cadmium.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Report: EBO2104022-C035 · EBO Center</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">UKCA Declaration (Great Britain)</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations (SI 2016/1091) for the UK market.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Attestation: ADCDGB220621 · BACL Corp</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">Battery MSDS & UN38.3 Safe Transport</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">Full material safety data sheet and air/sea hazard classification for lithium battery packs.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Report: CRT Co. · UN38.3 Certified</span>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px;">
        <strong style="color:#0f172a; font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">IPX7 Laboratory Waterproof Test</strong>
        <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#64748b; margin:0 0 8px;">100% negative-pressure vacuum chamber test ensuring zero ingress at 1-meter immersion.</p>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600;">Standard: IEC 60529 IPX7 Submersible</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 03 / Citation blockquote -->
    <div style="margin: 36px 0 32px; background: #ffffff; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 18px 24px; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(15,23,42,0.04);">
      <blockquote style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155;">
        "BOHOL cleanroom injection molding and finished product assembly strictly comply with ISO 13485:2016 quality management systems and FDA 21 CFR § 177.2600 liquid silicone elastomer safety regulations. Every batch undergoes automated leak detection, high-voltage insulation tests, and full traceability logging."
        <footer style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">
          — Audited under <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/59752.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0284c7; text-decoration: underline;">ISO 13485:2016</a> &amp; <a href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/cfrsearch.cfm?fr=177.2600" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0284c7; text-decoration: underline;">FDA 21 CFR § 177.2600</a>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 12px;">How Can OEM Partners Request Official Certificate Dossiers Under NDA?</h2>
    <p>Complete unredacted high-resolution PDF certificate test reports, raw metrology logs, and bill-of-materials declarations are available to authorized OEM brand clients and wholesale distributors upon bilateral NDA.</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/8618588583798" class="text-link" target="_blank">Request Certificate Dossier via WhatsApp (+86 185 8858 3798) <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a>
  </article>
</Layout>
